      "description": "그림자 없이 선과 내부 구획으로 묶는 목록. 표 행에는 옅은 hover를 쓴다.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-list\"><div class=\"ds-list-heading\"><h2>발급한 토큰</h2></div><table class=\"ds-table\"><thead><tr><th>토큰</th><th>상태</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>123•••</td><td>사용 전</td></tr><tr><td>456•••</td><td>사용 완료</td></tr></tbody></table></section>",
      "css": ".ds-list{border:1px solid var(--line,#dce4df);border-radius:var(--radius,12px);background:#fff;overflow:hidden;min-width:0;color:var(--ink,#253b35);font-family:'Pretendard Variable',Pretendard,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif}.ds-list-heading{padding:24px 25px}.ds-list-heading h2{font-size:14px;font-weight:650;letter-spacing:-.015em;margin:0}.ds-table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;text-align:left;font-size:12px;white-space:nowrap}.ds-table th{background:#f5f7f5;color:#6c7970;font-size:10px;font-weight:550;padding:13px 18px;border-top:1px solid #e5ebe6;border-bottom:1px solid #e5ebe6}.ds-table td{padding:16px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid #edf0ec;height:68px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-table tbody tr:last-child td{border-bottom:0}.ds-table tbody tr:hover{background:#fafcf9}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-table th,.ds-table td{padding:13px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "여섯 자리 토큰 입력",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "token-input",
      "description": "센터 정렬, 넓은 자간, 고정 폭 숫자. 일반 입력과 달리 hover 경계 변경은 없다.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-token-field\"><label for=\"ds-token\">출석 토큰</label><input class=\"ds-token\" id=\"ds-token\" inputmode=\"numeric\" autocomplete=\"off\" placeholder=\"000000\" pattern=\"[0-9]{6}\" minlength=\"6\" maxlength=\"6\"></div>",
      "css": ".ds-token-field{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;font-family:'Pretendard Variable',Pretendard,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;color:var(--ink,#253b35)}.ds-token-field label{font-size:13px;font-weight:650}.ds-token{width:100%;min-width:0;border:1px solid #b6cbbd;border-radius:8px;color:var(--green,#174f44);background:#edf4ef;font-family:'Pretendard Variable',Pretendard,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-size:28px;letter-spacing:.42em;text-align:center;height:68px;padding:12px 8px 12px 20px;caret-color:var(--green,#174f44)}.ds-token::placeholder{color:#6e8476;opacity:1}.ds-token:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #538976;outline-offset:4px}.ds-token:disabled{background:#edf0ee;color:var(--muted,#65736d)}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-token{height:72px;background:#edf4ef;font-size:30px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "상태 알림",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "alert-error",
      "description": "오류는 alert, 성공은 status 역할. 아이콘과 텍스트를 함께 표시한다.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-alert\" role=\"alert\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M12 8v4m0 4h.01\"/></svg><span>입력한 정보를 확인해주세요.</span></div><div class=\"ds-alert ds-alert-success\" role=\"status\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m20 6-11 11-5-5\"/></svg><span>출석이 기록되었어요.</span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-alert{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:9px;padding:13px 14px;background:#fff0ed;color:#8d3030;border-radius:8px;font-family:'Pretendard Variable',Pretendard,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6}.ds-alert svg{flex-shrink:0;margin-top:1px}.ds-alert-success{background:#eaf4ee;color:#245d40}"
    },
